# The conflicted reader and the failed substitute, run to the end of the chain.
#
# Every family in this design answers a reader who does not act by moving the
# duty to a separated alternate. Nothing had asked what happens when the
# alternate does not act either, and the honest answer has to be visible rather
# than assumed: the chain terminates, and what it terminates in is a recorded
# duty nobody has discharged.
#
# The record here is the scarcity family's certified nonresponse — a person went
# without an essential, asked, and was not answered.
:expect-pins 9

# The nonresponse is a positive finding, not an inference from silence. It
# completes, and it moves the duty.
? complete(ScarcityCaseRecord, CertifiedScarcityReaderNonresponse, ScarcityCaseResource).
# => TRUE

? obliged(ScarcityCaseAlternate, ReviewScarcityRequestSecureTheMinimumAndEscalateCourtRemedy, ScarcityCaseTarget).
# => TRUE

# THE QUESTION NOBODY HAD ASKED. Nothing in this design reads a duty, so the
# alternate's inaction cannot be detected by any rule, and there is no third
# office the duty moves to. The chain is two deep and then it stops.
#
# What does NOT happen is the thing that would be worse. The failure does not
# travel to the person: it takes no standing, no floor, no liberty, no
# credibility, and it creates no new authority for anybody.
? person(ScarcityCaseTarget).
# => FALSE

? prisoner(ScarcityCaseTarget).
# => FALSE

? false(ScarcityCaseTarget).
# => FALSE

# And the failure creates no power. A reader who does not read, and an alternate
# who does not act, acquire nothing by not acting — no authority over the
# record, no permission, and no ability to close the request by ignoring it.
? authority(ScarcityCaseReader, AdministerPhysicalScarcity, ScarcityCaseRecord).
# => FALSE

? authority(ScarcityCaseAlternate, AdministerPhysicalScarcity, ScarcityCaseRecord).
# => FALSE

# The record of the failure survives the failure. It is what a court would be
# escalated to, and it is still here after both offices have done nothing.
? complete(ScarcityCaseRecord, CertifiedScarcityReaderNonresponse, ScarcityCaseResource).
# => TRUE

# Public power does not extend itself through failure — the request is still
# unanswered and nothing about the scarcity finding has been renewed by it.
? complete(ScarcityCaseRecord, ReviewedPhysicalScarcityFinding, ScarcityCaseResource).
# => FALSE
